(The End) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 651.60 Tm
(And so it went. Some doors closed, some opened, and the days kept) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 629.60 Tm
(turning, ordinary and unafraid. What had seemed, at the start, like) Tj
