BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 607.60 Tm
(the whole of the world turned out to be only the beginning of it.) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 585.60 Tm
(The road went on, as roads do, and the people on it kept walking,) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 563.60 Tm
(and that was enough.) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 531.60 Tm
(In the end the only thing that had ever mattered was the thing that) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 509.60 Tm
(had always mattered: showing up, paying attention, and telling the) Tj
ET
BT
/F3 13 Tf
0.100 0.100 0.120 rg
1 0 0 1 60.00 487.60 Tm
(truth about what happened next. Everything else -- the fear, the) Tj
ET
